ahi -= suffix; bhi -= suffix;
// now handle middle
if (alo === ahi) { emit inserts b[blo..bhi]; emit suffix equals; }
else if (blo === bhi) { emit deletes; suffix equals; }
else { split; push suffix frame, right frame, left frame }
```

